      source of truth for the addon chain + ignore_hosts compose
      logic. RuntimeMaxSec=21600 hygiene cycle matches the WAF LXC.
    - Cutover is OPT-IN (no automatic switchover in postinst). The
      provisioner prints the exact nft replace + systemctl disable
