    - new GET /wg/r3-check returns {tunnel:bool, peer_ip}.
    - landing.html.j2 JS : same-origin HTTPS R3 probe (replaces broken
      cross-origin HTTP image probe that Safari blocked as mixed content).
    - cert-trust probe targets duckduckgo.com (non-whitelisted host)
      via fetch(no-cors) instead of gstatic Image (HTTP 204 ambiguity).
  * Phase 7 (#498) — Network Manager :
    - new GET /wg/profile/new.nmconnection emits NetworkManager keyfile
      with private-key-flags=0 so Cosmic/GNOME/KDE can import + connect
      without nmcli --ask.
