    - nginx/toolbox.conf : limit_req zone=sbx_toolbox_admin rate=20r/s
      burst=40 nodelay on /api/v1/toolbox/admin/* against runaway
      dashboard polling.
    - nginx/secubox-toolbox-limits.conf : http-context zone declaration.

